# Backend Development Rules

## Tech Stack
- Use Python 3.13+
- Use Poetry 2.1+ for dependency management
- Use Pydantic 2.11+ for data validation
- Use Typer for CLI development
- Use Black and Ruff for code formatting and linting

## Code Organization
- Use strongly typed Python throughout
- Follow domain-driven design principles
- Implement clear separation of concerns
- Design services with well-defined boundaries
- Use dependency injection for testability

## API Design
- Design APIs with versioning in mind
- Implement comprehensive error handling
- Document all API endpoints with examples
- Validate all input against schemas
- Return consistent error responses

## Testing
- Use pytest for all testing
- Implement unit tests for core functionality
- Use integration tests for component interactions
- Use fixtures to minimize test setup duplication
- Test error handling and edge cases
